INT. SYNERGY PARTNERS - OPEN OFFICE - DAY

Standing desks, a ping-pong table nobody plays, a whiteboard that says "DISRUPT" in six colors.

BRADLEY ONYEKACHI, thirties, in a quarter-zip, stands at the head of a huddle. PRISCILLA FAIRWEATHER, forties, clutches a laptop. DONOVAN "DOC" ELLISWORTH, fifties, sits on a beanbag with a coffee. A speakerphone on the table blinks red.

BRADLEY
Okay, team. Quick pulse check on the pivot.

PRISCILLA
Which pivot?

DOC
The one from Tuesday or the one from lunch?

BRADLEY
The one from the lunch of Tuesday.

PRISCILLA
Oh. That pivot.

SPEAKERPHONE (V.O.)
Hello? Are you there? This is Greg from Corporate. I can hear you but you can't hear me.

DOC
We can hear you, Greg.

BRADLEY
(over Doc)
Greg! Great to have you!

PRISCILLA
(over both)
Greg, can you mute?

SPEAKERPHONE (V.O.)
I'm not on mute. Am I on mute?

BRADLEY
We can hear you.

DOC
He can't hear us.

SPEAKERPHONE (V.O.)
Did someone say something?

Bradley sinks into a chair. Priscilla closes her laptop. Doc sips his coffee.

DOC (CONT'D)
Well. Synergy.
